00:12:37.720 --> 00:12:38.664
- Where's the line between

00:12:38.664 --> 00:12:40.510
being satisfied and being ambitious?

00:12:40.510 --> 00:12:41.530
- That's a great question.

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:43.770
Satisfied is a complicated word,

00:12:43.770 --> 00:12:46.310
what I would argue is being content

00:12:46.310 --> 00:12:47.970
and grateful for what you have,

00:12:47.970 --> 00:12:50.260
and not envious for what you don't have.

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:52.598
While still being ambitious

00:12:52.598 --> 00:12:54.120
is a different way to think
about being satisfied.

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:55.890
Being satisfied I actually think

00:12:55.890 --> 00:12:58.380
is too close to be complacent.

00:12:58.380 --> 00:13:02.070
I think when you are content
and grateful for what you have

00:13:02.070 --> 00:13:04.200
while still staying ambitious,

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:06.230
that's a better and more
sustainable framework.

00:13:06.230 --> 00:13:09.190
Never be satisfied, always be grateful,

00:13:09.190 --> 00:13:11.740
always push yourself
for the next ambition.

