00:13:39.797 --> 00:13:43.640
Always approach everything you
hear that is new with maybe,

00:13:43.640 --> 00:13:45.060
because I think what you're feeling

00:13:45.060 --> 00:13:47.400
from a lot of your friends
right now with Web3

00:13:47.400 --> 00:13:50.470
is the world is intoxicated
with seeing new things

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:51.510
and answering no.

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:54.490
And what has boded so well
for me over the last 25 years

00:13:54.490 --> 00:13:55.540
is I go, "Maybe."

00:13:55.540 --> 00:13:57.530
Then put in the work and most of the time

00:13:57.530 --> 00:13:59.100
come up with a conclusion of no.

00:13:59.100 --> 00:14:01.480
It's when you come up
with a conclusion of yes,

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:03.940
after you started with maybe
and you did the homework

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:05.520
where all the magic happens.

00:14:05.520 --> 00:14:08.120
So approach every new thing that you hear

00:14:08.120 --> 00:14:09.560
with the concept of maybe.

00:14:09.560 --> 00:14:11.880
And then have the humility,
this is the big one,

00:14:11.880 --> 00:14:14.300
have the humility to put in the work.

00:14:14.300 --> 00:14:16.740
Because your time is not
as valuable as you think

00:14:16.740 --> 00:14:19.870
to pass on the next thing
that's gonna change the world.

