00:14:43.140 --> 00:14:45.110
The number one thing
that holds back people

00:14:45.110 --> 00:14:47.210
from doing what they want is valuing

00:14:47.210 --> 00:14:49.130
the judgment of other people.

00:14:49.130 --> 00:14:50.590
As long as you have the humility

00:14:50.590 --> 00:14:52.800
to be a 22 year old freshman in college,

00:14:52.800 --> 00:14:54.230
then you should do your business.

00:14:54.230 --> 00:14:56.100
And again, what's putting pressure on you

00:14:56.100 --> 00:14:58.580
is the way your friends
are living right now.

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:00.630
But I always believe
that somebody else's life

00:15:00.630 --> 00:15:02.350
really has no impact on yours.

00:15:02.350 --> 00:15:04.550
You chose this for a reason don't bail

00:15:04.550 --> 00:15:05.390
