00:15:45.330 --> 00:15:47.390
- One thing that will
never be decentralized

00:15:47.390 --> 00:15:48.500
is human behavior.

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:50.770
Of course there's gonna be
bad behavior in the Metaverse,

00:15:50.770 --> 00:15:52.130
there's bad behavior everywhere.

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:53.340
Humans are flawed.

00:15:53.340 --> 00:15:55.270
People do things when they're unhappy,

00:15:55.270 --> 00:15:56.810
people do things when they're desperate.

00:15:56.810 --> 00:15:58.890
And so I think it's fascinating

00:15:58.890 --> 00:16:01.360
to watch people judge platforms,

00:16:01.360 --> 00:16:03.190
for things that humans are actually doing.

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:05.660
Social media hasn't changed people

00:16:05.660 --> 00:16:07.580
the way that people want to say it is.

00:16:07.580 --> 00:16:09.830
It's exploiting the truth,

00:16:09.830 --> 00:16:11.720
which is people are
showing their true actions

00:16:11.720 --> 00:16:14.576
and that will happen on the Metaverse.

