Thank you for time to be with us Gary.

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:38.300
- It is super lovely
to be with all of you,

00:16:38.300 --> 00:16:39.250
thank you so much.

00:16:39.250 --> 00:16:42.210
The rules of the world on when you should

00:16:42.210 --> 00:16:45.730
have your life figured out,
when you should be married,

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:48.610
have children, make money, buy a home,

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:51.440
and everything else
are based completely on

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:54.680
when people live to 45
and 55 years old, period.

00:16:54.680 --> 00:16:57.340
The problem with that
is we're living to 100.

00:16:57.340 --> 00:16:59.750
The concept that a 25 year old

00:16:59.750 --> 00:17:02.890
should have everything
figured out is laughable.

00:17:02.890 --> 00:17:05.630
Most 60 year olds I know don't
have their life figured out.

00:17:05.630 --> 00:17:08.160
Why are 25 year olds
putting such pressure?

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:09.890
I think that we have societally

00:17:09.890 --> 00:17:12.260
done a very poor job to our youth.

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:14.540
One of the great reasons
I struggle with the way

00:17:14.540 --> 00:17:16.930
that education is sold in our society

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:19.530
is we train kids from a very young age

00:17:19.530 --> 00:17:23.120
that you will be judged every
90 days on your actions.

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:26.490
I think it leads to very,
very vulnerable behavior

00:17:26.490 --> 00:17:27.990
that maps to our adulthood.

00:17:27.990 --> 00:17:30.550
So yes, I think that way too many people

00:17:30.550 --> 00:17:32.860
are judging themselves in the short term.

00:17:32.860 --> 00:17:35.630
Yes, I believe that if
you are 63 years old,

00:17:35.630 --> 00:17:37.610
you still have 30 years to achieve

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:38.810
fulfillment and happiness.

00:17:38.810 --> 00:17:40.100
And I think it's time that we have

00:17:40.100 --> 00:17:42.610
a totally different
conversation around age.

00:17:42.610 --> 00:17:44.650
To the point where in actuality,

00:17:44.650 --> 00:17:47.330
the fact that we pressure
children into starting

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:50.680
to get serious at 22
is actually ludicrous.

00:17:50.680 --> 00:17:53.750
22 to 30 should be wild, high risk,

00:17:53.750 --> 00:17:56.110
high reward behavior
because it's practical.

00:17:56.110 --> 00:17:58.630
Because even if you blow
it and nothing goes well,

00:17:58.630 --> 00:18:01.420
you can start getting serious at 30, 35.

00:18:01.420 --> 00:18:03.270
And so we ask people to now

00:18:03.270 --> 00:18:05.130
you're a grown up get a real job,

00:18:05.130 --> 00:18:07.690
and all this other ludicrous behavior

00:18:07.690 --> 00:18:09.590
that I think has really hurt society.

00:18:09.590 --> 00:18:12.450
I think it's quite depressing,
for lack of a better word,

00:18:12.450 --> 00:18:14.410
that there are people
that are 40 years old

00:18:14.410 --> 00:18:17.453
still have 60 years ahead of
them and they think it's over.

00:18:17.453 --> 00:18:19.222
I think that needs to stop.

