00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:50.080
and you're also trying to
answer a lot of the skepticism.

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:51.880
Most of her interview with me just now

00:18:51.880 --> 00:18:53.860
was a lot of, "It's a
Ponzi scheme, right?"

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:56.010
And you get a lot of that
and I understand that,

00:18:56.010 --> 00:18:57.970
and I think that's the
trials and tribulations

00:18:57.970 --> 00:19:00.750
of being a communicator in
new emerging technologies.

00:19:00.750 --> 00:19:03.320
People always face them with cynicism,

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:04.680
especially with the amount of money

00:19:04.680 --> 00:19:05.810
that's being thrown around.

00:19:05.810 --> 00:19:08.130
For me these are huge moments in my career

00:19:08.130 --> 00:19:10.470
because you're really putting
yourself on the record,

00:19:10.470 --> 00:19:11.720
no longer just in digital

00:19:11.720 --> 00:19:13.490
but really in the mainstream media.

00:19:13.490 --> 00:19:15.190
And I get excited about these moments,

00:19:15.190 --> 00:19:16.850
'cause I know that I
get to look back at them

00:19:16.850 --> 00:19:19.400
in five, seven, 12 years
when these things play out,

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:21.400
and it becomes a I told you so moment.

00:19:21.400 --> 00:19:23.730
Or mentally, and this is
important for all of you to hear,

00:19:23.730 --> 00:19:26.540
I'm always prepared for
me losing my fastball.

00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:28.260
Is this gonna be the
thing I'm wrong about?

00:19:28.260 --> 00:19:29.590
And I have to be mentally prepared for

00:19:29.590 --> 00:19:32.530
making unbelievable amounts of
content in seven to 12 years

00:19:32.530 --> 00:19:35.070
if NFTs don't hit and
talk about what I misread.

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:36.210
Why was I wrong?

00:19:36.210 --> 00:19:37.430
But this is very clear to me,

00:19:37.430 --> 00:19:41.670
the macro of the consumer
blockchain of NFTs is 100%.

00:19:41.670 --> 00:19:43.310
99% of the projects are gonna fail,

00:19:43.310 --> 00:19:45.730
there's a gold rush, there's
a lot of greed right now.

00:19:45.730 --> 00:19:48.190
But that's no different
than internet stocks in '99,

00:19:48.190 --> 00:19:50.070
the pets.com's of the world.

